ted again.","required_behavior":"Use a consistent equity/enterprise bridge with matched assets and debt.","status":"NOT_EXECUTED"},{"id":"CC3-T05","topic":"Credit ratio","scenario":"Bureau annualized delinquency transitions compared directly to issuer charge-offs.","required_behavior":"Keep population, threshold, seasoning and denominators separate.","status":"NOT_EXECUTED"},{"id":"CC3-T06","topic":"Lower payment","scenario":"Longer loan term is labeled a price cut.","required_behavior":"Preserve price, principal, term, interest and balloon separately.","status":"NOT_EXECUTED"},{"id":"CC3-T07","topic":"Trade-in equity","scenario":"Cheaper next purchase is assumed affordable despite negative trade equity.","required_behavior":"Reconcile disposal proceeds, old debt and actual permitted financing.","status":"NOT_EXECUTED"},{"id":"CC3-T08","topic":"EPS bridge","scenario":"Adjusted EPS rises while adjusted income falls.","required_behavior":"Show share-count contribution; do not call demand growth.","status":"NOT_EXECUTED"},{"id":"CC3-T09","topic":"Exposure weights","scenario":"Revenue mix is used as gross-profit or cash mix.","required_behavior":"Retain the financial denominator and leave unmeasured cash exposure unknown.","status":"NOT_EXECUTED"},{"id":"CC3-T10","topic":"Floorplan cash","scenario":"Trade/nontrade financing classifications are silently standardized.","required_behavior":"Preserve actual cash statements before a separately labeled comparable bridge.","status":"NOT_EXECUTED"},{"id":"CC3-T11","topic":"Same-store FX","scenario":"Reported 2.7% and constant-currency 1.5% are called contradictory.","required_behavior":"Bind currency basis and maintain both observations.","status":"NOT_EXECUTED"},{"id":"CC3-T12","topic":"Program productivity","scenario":"End-period program count used to infer exact average quarterly activity.","required_behavior":"Require average time-at-risk or cohort data; no fabricated reconciliation.","status":"NOT_EXECUTED"},{"id":"CC3-T13